    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 4:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "«Anuú waawutmo Nebukadnesa kuungá' xoordu sleémeero nee tlahh'i sleémeero nee tsifri sleémeero ar gawaá daanduú yaamu sleémeero gooír naa gooiím ngi ya/aáw amorhúng. Aníng kuungá' nun waydú yaariír i slaá'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.4.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.4.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 4:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aníng aga slaá' kaanguú layu nee muruú waa/oo/amo nguwa dirhungí gooiim kudá' Munguú úr naa dir'eéní tleéhh ngiwa dír kuungá' i oo'.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.4.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.4.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 4:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.4.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.4.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 4:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "«Anuú Nebukadnesa aáng ana hoót dír dooeé' wa ale ar yaandahhooa, nee ana hoót ar diihhooa baraá dooeé' kuduú waawuti'iimaro. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.4.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.4.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 4:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ala tlata kaariya' awa iga dae tsatiye' ina tlatitiím, qoomár niwa guu' gawaá qatanir'eé' wa alé, inslawaydá' nee iigu'utudae aníng ina ló'wa dae tsatiyé'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.4.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.4.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 4:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gawaá adoorihe múk sageeloén sleémeero oo yaamaá Babuloni una ádbáw niwa hardihiya' dír geeraaeé' as tlataeé' kudá' ngiwa waagweeriya'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.4.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.4.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 4:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naagáy qwaslaare, nee da/aluuse nee xu'utuusér tlata nee xu'utuusér tsatse/uwo kingay huúw. Ngiri tlataaeéni alki/iít. Ala inooín waagweermooro ngiri harslaqatiyé'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.4.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.4.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 4:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alhhe'eesaywo Danieli niri hardáh, kudá' sleeme ta umuú Belteshasár ateetin, umuú Munguueé'. Inós qeeruú munguaá hhohho' gu koóm baraawose, aníng tlataaeé' ngiri alki/iít, una báw, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.4.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.4.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 4:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aá Belteshasa, kuúnguduú qwaslaarmoó úr dír qwasleeriwo. Aníng a xuú' adór qeeruú munguiidá' hhohho' ir baraawók, nee a xuú' adór naaqór ta waagwetká ir káhh. Gaarí an tlataaeé', kuúng dir'eénií waagweerang. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.4.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.4.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 4:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Qoomár niwa qaát iigu'utuwí una ár xa'anoó tleerantleér ló'wa alé i baraá tla/ángw yaamu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.4.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.4.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 4:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Xa'anoodá' ina kumiít urarango, iri tlaáhh ló'wa ale. Tsitseeniwós niri hardihiyé' gawaá doori. Iri geehhooúy umuú diiro gawaá daanduú yaamuwo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.4.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.4.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 4:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Loo/orós ka ló'wa hhohho'. Mamaá yaariir gina laqwaál awa daanduú yaamu ngi buá' /aymisiro. Makaay sleémeero awa daanduú yaamu mahhtí ngiri slayé' dír gamuuwós wa aleeró, nee tsir/ór doori ina iwiiwít gawaá haleemiiwós. Muruú slaáf sleémeero muruú /ayma guna sláy dír xa'anoowí wa aleeró. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.4.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.4.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 4:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Qoomár niwa qaát gawaá qatanir'eé', iigu'utu una ár, malaykamoó Mungú nina aweér gawaá doorí wa alé. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.4.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.4.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 4:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iri tseé' ar afór ur i kaahi, ‹Xa'anoowí tsataak, haleemiiwós alkwaslaak loo/oorós bu'uumaak, mamuuwós tsiyayaxaak, masók makaá sla/a i diya/aatiyá' baraá mahhtírose, nee tsir/o i tlatlahh gawaá haleemiiwose. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.4.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.4.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 4:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ala guftano nee dee/aaruwose mawaak baraá hhape, nee gitsór naa/ ar baraá qamu, nee masók kaa tseék ar himuú muqsli nee oo muqslír sirdaa/aat. Heesíng mawaak, ku naa/amiisi nee har'uú gawaá dooraá daáhh, mawaak i hooti dinkwa nee makaá sla/a, nee i qay, gitsór baraá xatso ngi /ayi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.4.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.4.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 4:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Fuquraangós kudá' oo heeuuma warqesaak, fuqurangduú makiito'ór sla/a haniisaak har afiqoomár kureeraá faanqwe.› ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.4.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.4.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 4:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gaarí an sakwasleemadá' taa oó' nee malaykér Mungú, a gár taa oó' nee inooínaadá hhohho', as muu sleémeero umuú diiro kawa tsaahhi adór Munguú úr ir aleesleemuú kón daanduú waawuti'iima sleémeero ar muko, nee inós waawutmoó i slai gun tsawaar, tam heedaádá' liitlaákw kuduú alhhe'eesáy gun waawutmoó wá qaas.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.4.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.4.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 4:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.4.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.4.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 4:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "«Gaarí an tlatadá' aníng Nebukadnesa naa tlatitiím. Hám daxta kuúng Belteshasa tlataaká' waagweerang asma mukdá' fuqurángw koóm sleémeero baraá waawuti'iimar'eene nga harslaaqatiyé' waagweeraro, ala kuúng i aleesleér, asma qeeruú munguiidá' hhohho' i baraawók i dirii'.»",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.4.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.4.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 4:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.4.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.4.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 4:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Qoomaarihe Danielidá' ta babay Belteshasa iri gurhamuút gár niinawe, nee inslawaywós iri amooqwaqwadín. Waawutmo Belteshasa guri báy, «Belteshása tlataaká' muwa dae tsatiyé'.»",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.4.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.4.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 4:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Belteshasa iri oó', «Aakooeé', tlataaká i pa/iye' amór mukdá' kuúng u ahhiít, nee gár tlataaká' i laqaaqana' i pa/ amór wakuuseerók. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.4.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.4.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 4:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Xa'anoodá' taa aán aa uraaray nee aa /uuruú tleehh, kudá' haleemiiwós tlet, nay hardihiyé' gawaá doori, niri geehhoouyé' daanduú yaamu sleémeerowo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.4.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.4.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 4:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Loo/oorós handá' ka hhohho', nee mamuuwós ki yaariir, muuruú slaáf /aymisiro i bu'uutiyá'. Makaá sla/a in mahhetusiyá' baraá mahhtírós wa ale, nee tsir/ór gawaá doori iwa iwiiwiti gawaá haleemiiwós.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.4.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.4.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 4:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.4.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.4.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 4:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "«Gimáy, xa'anoodá' an kuúng waawutámo, kudá' aa uraaray nee /uuruú koóm. Yangareemaawók naa hardihiyé' ay gawaá doori nee waawuti'iimarók aa iia tleeruúr ay alhhe'eesoó yaamu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.4.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.4.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 4:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aluuwo malaykamoó Mungú kuri aán oo gawaá dooraá daáhh, iri oó', ‹Xa'anoowí tsataak, hhaamiisaak, ala guftanoowós mawaak nee dee/aruuwose baraá hhapeérií ale, daqaní ku tsegá' ar himuú muqsli nee oo muqslír sirdaa/aten baraá gitsór dutlutluu/ ar baraá qamu. Heesíng mawaak ku naa/asi nee har'uú gawaá dooraá daáhh. Mawaak ta hooti nee makaá baraá sla/a har afiqoomoó kureeraá faanqwe.›",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.4.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.4.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 4:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.4.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.4.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 4:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "«Gaarí an kángw tlataawók, aakooeé'. Adoorí an adoodá' Munguú úr a slaá' tleehhamoro daanduuwoge. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.4.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.4.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 4:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuúng tu guus dír muko. Kuúng tari hót nee makaá baraá sla/a, gitso a /ák adór slér wá ale, har'uú doori uri na/aas. An baraá sla/atá wa hót kureeri faanqwe, ay dír kay tsáhh adór Mungú ir baaliilín baraá waawuti'iimár muko, nee inós waawuti'iima gan haniis dír kudá' ngir slai. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.4.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.4.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 4:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Slám hara'ayadár guftano nee dee/aaruuwós kiwa geexay gawaá yaamu, gár i laqaqaan a tí: Waawuti'iimarók kingi ki/is qoomár bara tsáhh adór Munguú gawaá doori tar baalusmo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.4.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.4.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 4:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gawaá adoorihe, aá waawutámo, gurbu'utaeé' tí iiaárí qaaseek. Tlakweema tlehhtuuwo maweek, gan'amu tleehheek, nee tlakweema maweek mukdá' ta baramaanuús gurtleemu ti tlehhit, daqaní deeloorók ar diihhooa ka tleerees.»",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.4.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.4.27"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
